Scope note

This MIT grant covers the source code in `code/`, `paper/v3/code/` and `tools/`.

The author-generated non-code content of this archive - result tables in `tables/`, records in
`evidence/`, manifests, configuration files and figures - is released under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/.

No licence is granted here over third-party material. Imagery and reference labels derived from
OpenEarthMap remain under the licences of their individual sources; the per-region register is in
`docs/data_attribution.md`. Pretrained network weights (DINOv2, ResNet18) are not distributed in this
archive and remain under their own terms.
